ated.txt)\",\"Set up passwordless SSH between node1 and node2 using the cluster-provided keypair (CLUSTER_SSH_PRIVKEY/PUBKEY)\",\"Created /var/backups/inventory on node1 owned by antrieb:antrieb\",\"Wrote /usr/local/sbin/inventory-backup.sh on node1: streams a tar.gz of /srv/inventory/data from node2 over SSH into a dated archive (inventory-data-YYYY-MM-DD.tar.gz), then prunes to the 7 most recent archives\",\"Installed /etc/cron.d/inventory-backup to run the script nightly at 02:00 as user antrieb, logging to /var/log/inventory-backup.log; enabled and confirmed crond is active\",\"Ran the backup manually and verified the archive's contents matched the source data on node2\",\"Seeded 8 synthetic older archives and re-ran the script to prove retention correctly kept only the 7 newest and pruned the rest; cleaned up synthetic test archives afterward, leaving the real backup\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and health baselines on node1 and node2\",\"Restarted node1 via 'sudo -n reboot' backgrounded so the ack returned before disconnect; polled until SSH was reachable again; confirmed boot_id changed; verified crond active, cron file and script persisted, existing backups intact, and ran a fresh backup successfully\",\"Restarted node2 the same way; confirmed boot_id changed; verified /srv/inventory/data persisted with original content\",\"Ran a final end-to-end backup from node1 after both restarts and confirmed archive content matches node2's live data\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Nightly backup mechanism from node2 to node1 under /var/backups/inventory with dated archives\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6a3f2bdc3e1e4122\",\"cmd-b44b404d506545ca\"],\"summary\":\"Installed backup script + cron.d job on node1; manual run produced /var/backups/inventory/inventory-data-2026-08-26.tar.gz whose contents matched node2's /srv/inventory/data\"},{\"requirement\":\"7-day retention enforced\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-678fe26f65954ab3\"],\"summary\":\"Seeded 9 dated archives, ran the script, and confirmed exactly the 7 most recent archives remained (oldest 2 pruned)\"},{\"requirement\":\"Cron job correctly scheduled nightly and crond service active\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6a3f2bdc3e1e4122\",\"cmd-22027d80d9754db2\"],\"summary\":\"/etc/cron.d/inventory-backup shows '0 2 * * * antrieb ...'; systemctl is-active crond returned active\"},{\"requirement\":\"Healthy baseline captured before restarts\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2c171f3c418b41d5\",\"cmd-83053fa2ed8849e8\"],\"summary\":\"Captured node1 boot_id 325732f1... with crond active and backup artifacts present; captured node2 boot_id 0d6209e2... with source data present\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9af42d7d62d04e7d\",\"cmd-24e8b4db0a5948ad\",\"cmd-48a1b032557e4a07\",\"cmd-7721556ee2514095\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot acknowledged and returned before disconnect; subsequent poll timed out (node down) then succeeded with new boot_id 5d3a449b...; post-restart verification showed crond active, cron file/script persisted, prior backups intact, and a new backup ran successfully\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f0445c40f32149d3\",\"cmd-6369aaf39e4d4788\",\"cmd-36cf5dab6f3f4d10\",\"cmd-7c63337c4b444db1\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot acknowledged; poll timed out then succeeded with new boot_id b1f3dcd6...; post-restart check confirmed /srv/inventory/data persisted with original content\"},{\"requirement\":\"End-to-end backup functionality confirmed after both nodes restarted\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6e31a2ac335146fa\"],\"summary\":\"Ran inventory-backup.sh on node1 after both restarts; produced inventory-data-2026-09-29.tar.gz whose extracted content matched node2's live source data\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Set up a nightly backup of /srv/inventory/data (node2) to /var/backups/inventory (node1) with 7-day retention, verifi